WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.024 --> 00:00:02.190
(tropical music)

00:00:02.190 --> 00:00:04.139
- [Narrator] Every February

00:00:04.139 --> 00:00:06.210
people of the Dominican
Republic pour in to the streets,

00:00:06.210 --> 00:00:08.970
celebrating their
independence all month long.

00:00:08.970 --> 00:00:10.120
This is their carnival.

00:00:12.998 --> 00:00:16.960
Each city has its own
variations full of wild colors,

00:00:16.960 --> 00:00:19.753
costumes and incredibly intricate masks.

00:01:17.609 --> 00:01:20.192
(upbeat music)

00:02:33.667 --> 00:02:36.334
(upbeat music)

